HEAD:docs/plans/phase-a/phase-a-plan.md:74:| `Cargo.toml` (workspace, `members = ["crates/*"]`, `[workspace.dependencies]` for every third-party crate the phase uses) | a-1 | Wave-2 sprints use `workspace = true` and edit only their own crate's `Cargo.toml`. A missing workspace dependency is an amendment to a-1, merged before the sprint that needs it. Amended (lead ruling S7, bc-lead, 2026-10-24, a-7): the sibling crates `bd-cache-store`, `sc-bd-cli` and `sc-cron` are in the table (a-7), in alphabetical position; a-8 adds identical lines for the first two, so whichever branch merges second resolves a trivial conflict. Lead-approved amendment (bc-lead, 2026-10-24, a-8 fix round 1): `bd-cache-store` and `sc-bd-cli` (path plus version 0.1.0) were added to `[workspace.dependencies]` for `bd-cache-py`, which uses `workspace = true` for them. Further lead-approved amendment (bc-lead, 2026-10-24, R12, a-8 fix round 3): `dunce = "1"` for the same crate's canonical project directory. |
